{% comment %}
  Prints "true" when a product is enquiry-only (James, 19 Nov 2026): frozen products
  (custom.food_type "Frozen", setting in Theme settings > APEX Feeds > Bulk enquiry products) or
  products tagged "enquiry-only".
  - Retail shoppers: enquire for bulk pricing through the contact form.
  - Wholesalers: order by email, freight quoted per order (Retailer Agreement 7.5; Ell, 19 Nov).
  snippets/apex-enquiry-panel shows the right one.
  @param {object} product
  Use: {%- capture enquiry_only -%}{%- render 'apex-enquiry-only', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign food_type = product.metafields.custom.food_type.value | join: ',' | downcase
  assign is_enquiry = false
  if settings.apex_enquiry_frozen and food_type contains 'frozen'
    assign is_enquiry = true
  endif
  if product.tags contains 'enquiry-only'
    assign is_enquiry = true
  endif
  if is_enquiry
    echo 'true'
  endif
-%}
